  "description": "A cached, header-only, drop-in replacement for dynamic_cast.\nfast_cast caches the vtable-to-offset result of each cast per thread, so repeated\ncasts of the same dynamic type cost a compare and an add instead of an RTTI walk,\nwhile returning exactly what dynamic_cast would. Pointer, reference and\nstd::shared_ptr overloads. Native, header-only, C++11 and later, any platform\nand architecture; referencing the package adds the include path.",
